  "prompt": "Which categories never sold an order line for less than 50 euros? Use the sales table and its category_name column. Return two columns, in this order: category_name and lowest_line_revenue_eur, the lowest net_revenue_eur on any of the category's lines. Return one row per category, and only the categories whose lowest line is 50.00 or more. Lines with a missing net_revenue_eur are left out. Do not round. Any row order is fine.",
